title: The forks folder
pid: 73be3889-5c61-4a49-b482-6e6f550dbb19
body: |2-
  The forks folder ('Folder::Forks', =forksFolder=) under an occurrence
  of a note N holds every mirror of N, each once, flat: N's fork
  partners (the notes N forks, or forkees, and those that fork it),
  and its *indirect members*, the other mirrors
  of N, joined to it only through others; all by records the skgrepo
  restriction shows. A *mutual* both forks N and is forked by it; a
  *forker-only member* forks N and is not forked by it.
contains:
- ce448f90-6a74-4b0c-b595-b88240efc546
- 9dcb4d7e-6dd5-4b02-a677-9966ba798a46
